&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(注)①  企業内容等の開示に関する内閣府令第19条第２項第９号の２(株主総会における議決権行使&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　　　の結果)の規定に基づく臨時報告書&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;(注)②　&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;企業内容等の開示に関する&lt;/span&gt;内閣府令第19条第２項第４号(&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;主要株主の異動)の規定に基づく&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　　　臨時報告書&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:54pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:OtherReferenceInformationTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:InformationAboutCompanyWhichProvidesGuaranteeToReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h1 class="smt_head1"&gt;第二部 【提出会社の保証会社等の情報】&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:InformationAboutCompanyWhichProvidesGuaranteeToReportingCompanyTextBlock>
